(5134915, 746938, 75192, '<td valign="top">nice tones</td>', 'nice tones', '2008-12-16 15:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5134921, 747444, 75192, '<td valign="top">To be honest, when I first saw this picture I did not see the little star at all, and I was left thinking "cute fish, but doesn''t really fit with the challenge". Now I''ve finally spotted it, I''m reviewing my score and giving you much higher. <br/> <br/>Personally I think to accentuate the gorgeously cute ickle star, I would have cropped somewhere around the fishes head to accentuate the fact that fishy is looking up at ickle star. This would have been a ribbon winning picture in my eyes....<br/> <br/>Wonderful effort though :)</td>', 'To be honest, when I first saw this picture I did not see the little star at all, and I was left thinking "cute fish, but doesn''t really fit with the challenge". Now I''ve finally spotted it, I''m reviewing my score and giving you much higher.  Personally I think to accentuate the gorgeously cute ickle star, I would have cropped somewhere around the fishes head to accentuate the fact that fishy is looking up at ickle star. This would have been a ribbon winning picture in my eyes.... Wonderful effort though :)', '2008-12-16 15:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5134922, 747450, 75192, '<td valign="top">lovely texture</td>', 'lovely texture', '2008-12-16 15:50:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5134923, 747380, 75192, '<td valign="top">ever so pretty, but it''s quite faint</td>', 'ever so pretty, but it''s quite faint', '2008-12-16 15:50:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5134924, 746910, 75192, '<td valign="top">nice idea, good setup.</td>', 'nice idea, good setup.', '2008-12-16 15:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5134929, 747167, 75192, '<td valign="top">It''s pretty, but to be honest, when I saw it I thought it looked like a picture someone would do on Paint. Maybe this is because of blur?<br/> <br/>Pretty colours though, good effort.</td>', 'It''s pretty, but to be honest, when I saw it I thought it looked like a picture someone would do on Paint. Maybe this is because of blur? Pretty colours though, good effort.', '2008-12-16 15:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5134932, 747454, 75192, '<td valign="top">We must always remember and honour those who suffered. Looking at this makes me very sad indeed.</td>', 'We must always remember and honour those who suffered. Looking at this makes me very sad indeed.', '2008-12-16 15:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5134934, 746239, 75192, '<td valign="top">I think you went to some effort taking this picture, but to my tastes it''s too over processed, and I don''t really like the effects you''ve presented. I think this would have been much better in its natural state i.e. without all the processing. <br/> <br/>Good luck :)</td>', 'I think you went to some effort taking this picture, but to my tastes it''s too over processed, and I don''t really like the effects you''ve presented. I think this would have been much better in its natural state i.e. without all the processing.  Good luck :)', '2008-12-16 15:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5134935, 747348, 75192, '<td valign="top">really like this one.... i absolutely love the bokeh!!!</td>', 'really like this one.... i absolutely love the bokeh!!!', '2008-12-16 15:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
