(5137650, 747444, 76430, '<td valign="top">I was fixated on the lovely Lion Fish and finally saw the star after a while.  Very nice colors, DOF and composition, though maybe it''s a little bit cramped it does maximize the detail.  Did you stick the "star" on the aquarium glass?  It really grabbed the fish''s attention.  Well done.</td>', 'I was fixated on the lovely Lion Fish and finally saw the star after a while.  Very nice colors, DOF and composition, though maybe it''s a little bit cramped it does maximize the detail.  Did you stick the "star" on the aquarium glass?  It really grabbed the fish''s attention.  Well done.', '2008-12-17 16:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5137658, 747472, 63633, '<td valign="top">Nice - Lensbaby image? Really does have a retro feel to it.</td>', 'Nice - Lensbaby image? Really does have a retro feel to it.', '2008-12-17 16:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5137659, 746672, 76430, '<td valign="top">Well, it''s a planet, but still a great photo.  I love the clouds and sunset coloring.  Is that a boat, buoy or oil derrick on the horizon?  I''m surprised at the bright yellow of it, and it really draws my attention.</td>', 'Well, it''s a planet, but still a great photo.  I love the clouds and sunset coloring.  Is that a boat, buoy or oil derrick on the horizon?  I''m surprised at the bright yellow of it, and it really draws my attention.', '2008-12-17 16:31:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5137851, 747341, 76430, '<td valign="top">I hate it when that happens!  But you made good use out of your broken ornament.  I hope you didn''t sacrifice it for the challenge.  Nice idea.  It just all looks a little too hazy to me.  Maybe it''s the ornament or the DOF.</td>', 'I hate it when that happens!  But you made good use out of your broken ornament.  I hope you didn''t sacrifice it for the challenge.  Nice idea.  It just all looks a little too hazy to me.  Maybe it''s the ornament or the DOF.', '2008-12-17 18:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5137855, 746343, 76430, '<td valign="top">Effective use of star filter.  Nice tree and background.</td>', 'Effective use of star filter.  Nice tree and background.', '2008-12-17 18:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5137856, 747437, 76430, '<td valign="top">Nice sky, but it''s such a barren looking landscape.  Maybe the color is off.  Nice starburst effect creating interesting color effects all the way to the tree.</td>', 'Nice sky, but it''s such a barren looking landscape.  Maybe the color is off.  Nice starburst effect creating interesting color effects all the way to the tree.', '2008-12-17 18:26:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5137857, 747379, 76430, '<td valign="top">Nice main subject, minor subjects and background, but it just doesn''t hold my attention.</td>', 'Nice main subject, minor subjects and background, but it just doesn''t hold my attention.', '2008-12-17 18:26:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5137862, 746825, 76430, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting plant, but it looks overly sharpened or something; maybe it really does look like that.  I had to Google it to find out, and it looks like the texture is pretty accurate but you did some major colorizing.  It''s an interesting background.  You met the challenge creatively.</td>', 'This is an interesting plant, but it looks overly sharpened or something; maybe it really does look like that.  I had to Google it to find out, and it looks like the texture is pretty accurate but you did some major colorizing.  It''s an interesting background.  You met the challenge creatively.', '2008-12-17 18:31:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5137864, 747440, 76430, '<td valign="top">I''m not a horse expert, but are you saying those are called stars on the foreheads?  I like that they are looking at you and the fence adds to the picture.</td>', 'I''m not a horse expert, but are you saying those are called stars on the foreheads?  I like that they are looking at you and the fence adds to the picture.', '2008-12-17 18:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5137865, 747382, 76430, '<td valign="top">Interesting way to shoot stars when you have the bad luck of overcast skies.  I like the vanishing point perspective.</td>', 'Interesting way to shoot stars when you have the bad luck of overcast skies.  I like the vanishing point perspective.', '2008-12-17 18:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5137866, 747076, 76430, '<td valign="top">Yes, it''s a star, but the setup could have been much better.  Clean up the cookie cutter, get rid of the wrinkles on the sheet or whatever it is.  I''m undecided about whether it would look better all in focus or with the shallow front DOF you have.  I do like the bright light behind it, but think it would be improved if the light was more in the center of it.  You cropped a bit too close on the bottom.  And the overall lighting needs to be better.</td>', 'Yes, it''s a star, but the setup could have been much better.  Clean up the cookie cutter, get rid of the wrinkles on the sheet or whatever it is.  I''m undecided about whether it would look better all in focus or with the shallow front DOF you have.  I do like the bright light behind it, but think it would be improved if the light was more in the center of it.  You cropped a bit too close on the bottom.  And the overall lighting needs to be better.', '2008-12-17 18:32:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5137869, 747466, 76430, '<td valign="top">I like the multi-tone green overall look here.  The macro is nice, but it doesn''t look very sharp.</td>', 'I like the multi-tone green overall look here.  The macro is nice, but it doesn''t look very sharp.', '2008-12-17 18:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5137870, 746239, 76430, '<td valign="top">OK, maybe he''s seeing stars, but it''s far too overprocessed and noisy for me.</td>', 'OK, maybe he''s seeing stars, but it''s far too overprocessed and noisy for me.', '2008-12-17 18:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5137875, 745908, 76430, '<td valign="top">It looks like a nice tree, but it''s not in good focus and the tree branches are in the way.  I think a different vantage point would be better here.</td>', 'It looks like a nice tree, but it''s not in good focus and the tree branches are in the way.  I think a different vantage point would be better here.', '2008-12-17 18:38:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5137879, 746719, 76430, '<td valign="top">I like this better than the overprocessed boxing one here.  It looks like it''s an action shot rather than just holding the glove against the face like we''ve seen here some other times.  Good timing.  It looks painful!</td>', 'I like this better than the overprocessed boxing one here.  It looks like it''s an action shot rather than just holding the glove against the face like we''ve seen here some other times.  Good timing.  It looks painful!', '2008-12-17 18:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5137884, 746968, 76430, '<td valign="top">Really nice scene, but if the moon is the main subject I''d like to see it between branches rather than hiding behind a branch.  Just a tiny bit left or right would put it in a space.  I really like the shadow effect on the snow.</td>', 'Really nice scene, but if the moon is the main subject I''d like to see it between branches rather than hiding behind a branch.  Just a tiny bit left or right would put it in a space.  I really like the shadow effect on the snow.', '2008-12-17 18:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5137892, 746856, 76430, '<td valign="top">I think it''s too overprocessed to be DPC friendly.  It looks like a totally black and white image with very little contrasting grey tones.</td>', 'I think it''s too overprocessed to be DPC friendly.  It looks like a totally black and white image with very little contrasting grey tones.', '2008-12-17 18:42:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5137927, 747437, 35638, '<td valign="top">Looks very cold.  Where was this taken?</td>', 'Looks very cold.  Where was this taken?', '2008-12-17 19:09:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5138198, 746165, 101714, '<td valign="top">Good detail. Lighting from back is well done. Expect to see more. :)</td>', 'Good detail. Lighting from back is well done. Expect to see more. :)', '2008-12-17 22:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
