(5141134, 746732, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nice setup and take on sugar cookies.  I love the crowd aspect of this.  Nicely done!</td>', 'Very nice setup and take on sugar cookies.  I love the crowd aspect of this.  Nicely done!', '2008-12-19 15:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
