(5141788, 747081, 35947, '<td valign="top">Excellent image!   ;D</td>', 'Excellent image!   ;D', '2008-12-19 19:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5141936, 747444, 811, '<td valign="top">Wow, I was so busy studying the fish and trying to find something "starry" about it, and thus had the picture "scrolled" so I could see all of the fish, I completely missed the starfish the first time around.    Now, it looks so obvious, I''m wondering how I missed it to begin with!</td>', 'Wow, I was so busy studying the fish and trying to find something "starry" about it, and thus had the picture "scrolled" so I could see all of the fish, I completely missed the starfish the first time around.    Now, it looks so obvious, I''m wondering how I missed it to begin with!', '2008-12-19 21:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5142053, 747382, 101117, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot and I like the reflections. I''m not sure how much the tree adds to it, I think it could be better with just the bridge as it is attractive enough on it''s own.</td>', 'This is a nice shot and I like the reflections. I''m not sure how much the tree adds to it, I think it could be better with just the bridge as it is attractive enough on it''s own.', '2008-12-20 00:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5142056, 747076, 101117, '<td valign="top">This is a nice idea, but there are a couple of aspects that take away from it. The brightest area is out of focus and that''s where my attention''s drawn to, meaning my initial reaction to the shot isn''t great, it might have been better if you either changed the focal point or changed where the light was coming through.<br/> <br/>The other thing is that there''s a lot of texture here, but the colours aren''t particularly attractive, perhaps a high contrast B&amp;W would have made it much better, just an idea.</td>', 'This is a nice idea, but there are a couple of aspects that take away from it. The brightest area is out of focus and that''s where my attention''s drawn to, meaning my initial reaction to the shot isn''t great, it might have been better if you either changed the focal point or changed where the light was coming through. The other thing is that there''s a lot of texture here, but the colours aren''t particularly attractive, perhaps a high contrast B&W would have made it much better, just an idea.', '2008-12-20 00:08:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5142061, 747345, 101117, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting subject, but I feel you could have improved it with a change of composition. The stars are attractive so it would be nice to have them all completely in the frame but as it stands you actually don''t have single complete one there. Also, some of the shot is out of focus, which doesn''t really help here, a bit more DOF could have made it better.</td>', 'This is an interesting subject, but I feel you could have improved it with a change of composition. The stars are attractive so it would be nice to have them all completely in the frame but as it stands you actually don''t have single complete one there. Also, some of the shot is out of focus, which doesn''t really help here, a bit more DOF could have made it better.', '2008-12-20 00:11:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5142064, 746672, 101117, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot with some great colours and general good exposure. One thing that is very distracting is the object two thirds along the horizon. I can''t make out what it is, which is just annoying and takes away from an otherwise good shot.<br/> <br/>As far as meeting the challenge, I appreciate there is a star, but it feels more like "squeezing it in" to make it fit :)</td>', 'This is a nice shot with some great colours and general good exposure. One thing that is very distracting is the object two thirds along the horizon. I can''t make out what it is, which is just annoying and takes away from an otherwise good shot. As far as meeting the challenge, I appreciate there is a star, but it feels more like "squeezing it in" to make it fit :)', '2008-12-20 00:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5142068, 747242, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice but could have done with a touch more detail, perhaps a very light fill flash to bring out a little more detail in the decoration.</td>', 'Nice but could have done with a touch more detail, perhaps a very light fill flash to bring out a little more detail in the decoration.', '2008-12-20 00:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5142069, 747309, 101117, '<td valign="top">Good shot of the moon, though without the subject would have absolutely no relevance to the theme.</td>', 'Good shot of the moon, though without the subject would have absolutely no relevance to the theme.', '2008-12-20 00:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5142071, 747348, 101117, '<td valign="top">While it''s an interesting idea neither the foreground or background are in focus, the circles of light which I assume are Christmas lights actually look a little like a bacteria sample under a microscope.<br/> <br/>I think this could have been better if something was in focus.</td>', 'While it''s an interesting idea neither the foreground or background are in focus, the circles of light which I assume are Christmas lights actually look a little like a bacteria sample under a microscope. I think this could have been better if something was in focus.', '2008-12-20 00:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5142072, 747384, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed and well lit, it''s the kind of thing you expect to see on the front of a Christmas card.</td>', 'Nicely composed and well lit, it''s the kind of thing you expect to see on the front of a Christmas card.', '2008-12-20 00:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5142074, 747440, 101117, '<td valign="top">Even with the title I don''t really see how this meets the challenge.</td>', 'Even with the title I don''t really see how this meets the challenge.', '2008-12-20 00:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5142075, 747180, 101117, '<td valign="top">This is very nice and was actually something I was going to try myself, but unfortunately I can''t bake, and probably wouldn''t have done as good a job with the shot as you did anyway!</td>', 'This is very nice and was actually something I was going to try myself, but unfortunately I can''t bake, and probably wouldn''t have done as good a job with the shot as you did anyway!', '2008-12-20 00:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5142078, 747461, 101117, '<td valign="top">Really like this, great colours!</td>', 'Really like this, great colours!', '2008-12-20 00:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5142192, 747230, 76430, '<td valign="top">It''s a star allright. The bright multi-color car is trying for my attention but I find myself disappointed I can''t see more of it, though for this challenge you did the right thing.</td>', 'It''s a star allright. The bright multi-color car is trying for my attention but I find myself disappointed I can''t see more of it, though for this challenge you did the right thing.', '2008-12-20 02:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5142193, 747302, 76430, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  I like the background stars and coloring</td>', 'Nice composition.  I like the background stars and coloring', '2008-12-20 02:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5142195, 747483, 76430, '<td valign="top">Good shallow DOF</td>', 'Good shallow DOF', '2008-12-20 02:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5142197, 746732, 76430, '<td valign="top">I love the snowing sugar and the cookies.  I love how they''re standing up.  how did you do it?//www.dpchallenge.com/challenge_vote_image.php?IMAGE_ID=746732#</td>', 'I love the snowing sugar and the cookies.  I love how they''re standing up.  how did you do it?//www.dpchallenge.com/challenge_vote_image.php?IMAGE_ID=746732#', '2008-12-20 02:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5142199, 747449, 76430, '<td valign="top">Good find.  I love the orientation, composition and postprocessing.</td>', 'Good find.  I love the orientation, composition and postprocessing.', '2008-12-20 02:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5142200, 747348, 76430, '<td valign="top">Not sure they look like the normal image of stars, but maybe more realistic.  This may have fit the Bokeh challenge better.  Nevertheless I do like the consistent light circles.  Very interesting.</td>', 'Not sure they look like the normal image of stars, but maybe more realistic.  This may have fit the Bokeh challenge better.  Nevertheless I do like the consistent light circles.  Very interesting.', '2008-12-20 02:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5142201, 747453, 76430, '<td valign="top">Good eye catching these succulents as stars.  Good isolation of the one.</td>', 'Good eye catching these succulents as stars.  Good isolation of the one.', '2008-12-20 02:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5142204, 746549, 76430, '<td valign="top">Good find and crop.  I''m just wondering if you''re trying to get too much in one shot.  The sunset overpowers the star making much of it very dark.  Maybe a fill flash would show the star better.</td>', 'Good find and crop.  I''m just wondering if you''re trying to get too much in one shot.  The sunset overpowers the star making much of it very dark.  Maybe a fill flash would show the star better.', '2008-12-20 02:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5142207, 747242, 76430, '<td valign="top">Christmas tree star?  It''s a bit dark but interesting star.</td>', 'Christmas tree star?  It''s a bit dark but interesting star.', '2008-12-20 02:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
