(5142442, 747330, 62187, '<td valign="top">Most times I don''t like centered objects. This time it works nicely. Everything else about your photo I find perfect: 10</td>', 'Most times I don''t like centered objects. This time it works nicely. Everything else about your photo I find perfect: 10', '2008-12-20 10:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5142443, 747474, 62187, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. The composition is perfect as well as the focus: 10</td>', 'Nicely done. The composition is perfect as well as the focus: 10', '2008-12-20 10:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5142444, 746732, 62187, '<td valign="top">You''ve achieved a very magical photo and it made me smile and feel like I was a kid again. Thanks! 10</td>', 'You''ve achieved a very magical photo and it made me smile and feel like I was a kid again. Thanks! 10', '2008-12-20 10:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5142446, 747472, 62187, '<td valign="top">Something about the photo makes me feel sad for the tree: like I want to take this thing home and give it a big hug. I like it a lot: 10</td>', 'Something about the photo makes me feel sad for the tree: like I want to take this thing home and give it a big hug. I like it a lot: 10', '2008-12-20 10:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5142449, 747458, 62187, '<td valign="top">What''s wrong with this photo? Nothing - Rock On: 10!</td>', 'What''s wrong with this photo? Nothing - Rock On: 10!', '2008-12-20 10:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5142451, 745820, 62187, '<td valign="top">It''s an excellent photo but I find is just ever so slightly shoehorn-ish. I''m going with a 9</td>', 'It''s an excellent photo but I find is just ever so slightly shoehorn-ish. I''m going with a 9', '2008-12-20 10:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5142453, 747484, 62187, '<td valign="top">Excellent - I think they wanted something other then real stars. But, did I say I think the photo is excellent? I think so: 10</td>', 'Excellent - I think they wanted something other then real stars. But, did I say I think the photo is excellent? I think so: 10', '2008-12-20 10:35:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5142454, 746549, 62187, '<td valign="top">I like the photo, the contrasting colors are great as well as the sense of depth that I get. The edges of the clouds around the light blue is strange: 9</td>', 'I like the photo, the contrasting colors are great as well as the sense of depth that I get. The edges of the clouds around the light blue is strange: 9', '2008-12-20 10:36:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5142456, 747345, 62187, '<td valign="top">Really? Soap? I wanted to eat them. I''m glad you told me it was soap. 9</td>', 'Really? Soap? I wanted to eat them. I''m glad you told me it was soap. 9', '2008-12-20 10:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5142457, 746910, 39880, '<td valign="top">A bit out of the box for the challenge, but I like it.  Giving it a 10, just because it looks so good.</td>', 'A bit out of the box for the challenge, but I like it.  Giving it a 10, just because it looks so good.', '2008-12-20 10:37:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5142459, 747483, 62187, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo - love the colors. To me, it looks just ever so slightly over sharpened: 9</td>', 'Very nice photo - love the colors. To me, it looks just ever so slightly over sharpened: 9', '2008-12-20 10:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5142460, 747384, 62187, '<td valign="top">You should make this into a Christmas card: 10</td>', 'You should make this into a Christmas card: 10', '2008-12-20 10:38:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5142461, 747475, 62187, '<td valign="top">How simply elegant looking: 10</td>', 'How simply elegant looking: 10', '2008-12-20 10:38:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5142463, 747379, 62187, '<td valign="top">What''s keeping this from being a 10? I think there are some bright white spots that could have been blurred down a bit. As is: 9</td>', 'What''s keeping this from being a 10? I think there are some bright white spots that could have been blurred down a bit. As is: 9', '2008-12-20 10:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5142468, 746672, 62187, '<td valign="top">At first, I wanted to vote this down. Like the sunset challenge that the winners seems focused on the seascape rather then the actual sunset, this photo looks like a photo of a sunset rather then stars. Like those ''Sunset'' photo, this is excellent too. The ''Fist Star'' brings it into the challenge more but what really captures my interest is that it really looks like there''s a HUGE star floating on the horizon. So, I''m going with a 10 for this one.</td>', 'At first, I wanted to vote this down. Like the sunset challenge that the winners seems focused on the seascape rather then the actual sunset, this photo looks like a photo of a sunset rather then stars. Like those ''Sunset'' photo, this is excellent too. The ''Fist Star'' brings it into the challenge more but what really captures my interest is that it really looks like there''s a HUGE star floating on the horizon. So, I''m going with a 10 for this one.', '2008-12-20 10:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5142469, 747137, 62187, '<td valign="top">I don''t know why this photo appeals to me so much. The bench with the blanket on it (far left) is the only downfall (to me): 8</td>', 'I don''t know why this photo appeals to me so much. The bench with the blanket on it (far left) is the only downfall (to me): 8', '2008-12-20 10:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5142472, 747392, 62187, '<td valign="top">Kinda looks like it''s falling from space: 8</td>', 'Kinda looks like it''s falling from space: 8', '2008-12-20 10:44:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5142479, 746825, 62187, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool. I Googled ''Bishop''s Cap Cactus'': too bad you didn''t find one with it''s flowers. That would have been awesome! As is, the edit is just slightly strange and not natural looking to me. I still like it: 8</td>', 'Pretty cool. I Googled ''Bishop''s Cap Cactus'': too bad you didn''t find one with it''s flowers. That would have been awesome! As is, the edit is just slightly strange and not natural looking to me. I still like it: 8', '2008-12-20 10:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5142480, 747081, 62187, '<td valign="top">Very simple and should be made into a Christmas Card: 10</td>', 'Very simple and should be made into a Christmas Card: 10', '2008-12-20 10:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5142481, 747162, 62187, '<td valign="top">For some reason, the graininess works for me in this photo: 8</td>', 'For some reason, the graininess works for me in this photo: 8', '2008-12-20 10:48:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5142484, 747290, 62187, '<td valign="top">Lot''s of focus on the city and not so much the stars. But, I know how that goes as I live in the city. Besides, the buildings ARE the stars of the city! 9</td>', 'Lot''s of focus on the city and not so much the stars. But, I know how that goes as I live in the city. Besides, the buildings ARE the stars of the city! 9', '2008-12-20 10:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5142487, 746859, 62187, '<td valign="top">Very errie and nicely done. Am interested in seeing your camera settings and time of day.</td>', 'Very errie and nicely done. Am interested in seeing your camera settings and time of day.', '2008-12-20 10:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5142488, 747076, 62187, '<td valign="top">I kinda like it: simple yet very effective. The color seems strange to me: 8</td>', 'I kinda like it: simple yet very effective. The color seems strange to me: 8', '2008-12-20 10:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5142655, 747449, 39880, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective.</td>', 'I like the perspective.', '2008-12-20 12:36:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5142656, 747219, 39880, '<td valign="top">Nice take on the challenge.  And a nice shot.</td>', 'Nice take on the challenge.  And a nice shot.', '2008-12-20 12:36:54.000000', NULL, 1),
