(5142678, 746239, 39880, '<td valign="top">looks a over processed.</td>', 'looks a over processed.', '2008-12-20 12:42:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5142681, 747306, 39880, '<td valign="top">Not really getting any wow out of this.  A longer exposure could help this.</td>', 'Not really getting any wow out of this.  A longer exposure could help this.', '2008-12-20 12:43:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5142682, 746938, 39880, '<td valign="top">Not really getting star out of this.  Light and exposure could be better.</td>', 'Not really getting star out of this.  Light and exposure could be better.', '2008-12-20 12:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5142683, 747385, 39880, '<td valign="top">Interesting take.  I''d like to see a bit more detail.</td>', 'Interesting take.  I''d like to see a bit more detail.', '2008-12-20 12:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5142686, 747309, 39880, '<td valign="top">I like the sharpness of the moon, but looks a bit over processed.</td>', 'I like the sharpness of the moon, but looks a bit over processed.', '2008-12-20 12:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5142689, 747309, 3936, '<td valign="top">Nice shot of the moon, the image appears a bit over processed.  Not the fringing around the top of the moon.  The rest of the sky appears a bit noisy.  Noon itself is very nice and sharp.  Overall 7</td>', 'Nice shot of the moon, the image appears a bit over processed.  Not the fringing around the top of the moon.  The rest of the sky appears a bit noisy.  Noon itself is very nice and sharp.  Overall 7', '2008-12-20 12:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5142696, 746715, 3936, '<td valign="top">The image looks a little tilted.  I would have liked it a little wider, the crop is a little tight on the sides for me.  The boy is a very nice touch in this composition.  I really like the lighting.  I gave you a 7</td>', 'The image looks a little tilted.  I would have liked it a little wider, the crop is a little tight on the sides for me.  The boy is a very nice touch in this composition.  I really like the lighting.  I gave you a 7', '2008-12-20 12:52:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5142699, 747175, 3936, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture.  Hope you write up how it was done.  Nice and sharp.</td>', 'Very nice capture.  Hope you write up how it was done.  Nice and sharp.', '2008-12-20 12:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5142703, 747444, 3936, '<td valign="top">Really cool image. Nice take on the challenge. 9</td>', 'Really cool image. Nice take on the challenge. 9', '2008-12-20 12:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5142719, 747341, 3936, '<td valign="top">I would have liked a little more depth of field here, so that the edges of the ornament would have remained sharp.  A little more saturation, and a little more contrast would have brought out the color also.  As is, the ornament looks a little faded.  Like the image was overly brightened, without a corresponding adjustment to the contrast.</td>', 'I would have liked a little more depth of field here, so that the edges of the ornament would have remained sharp.  A little more saturation, and a little more contrast would have brought out the color also.  As is, the ornament looks a little faded.  Like the image was overly brightened, without a corresponding adjustment to the contrast.', '2008-12-20 13:03:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5142721, 747446, 3936, '<td valign="top">Very nice job on the colors, and using depth of field to direct attention to the star.  The border is a little busy for me, and the red in it, distracts a bit from the image.  A 7 from me.</td>', 'Very nice job on the colors, and using depth of field to direct attention to the star.  The border is a little busy for me, and the red in it, distracts a bit from the image.  A 7 from me.', '2008-12-20 13:04:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5142723, 747439, 3936, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done.  The copper cookie cutter really makes the image.</td>', 'Very nicely done.  The copper cookie cutter really makes the image.', '2008-12-20 13:06:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5142728, 747481, 3936, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.  I really like the way you captured the subtle shadings of the light.  Top 10 maybe?</td>', 'Very pretty.  I really like the way you captured the subtle shadings of the light.  Top 10 maybe?', '2008-12-20 13:10:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5142759, 747454, 3936, '<td valign="top">Daring photo.  For me the color of the star, distracts a bit from the prisoners.  I''m wondering what this looked like in all B&amp;W or even sepia toned.  Interesting take on the challenge, and the photo makes a very strong statement.  I gave you a 9.</td>', 'Daring photo.  For me the color of the star, distracts a bit from the prisoners.  I''m wondering what this looked like in all B&W or even sepia toned.  Interesting take on the challenge, and the photo makes a very strong statement.  I gave you a 9.', '2008-12-20 13:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5142762, 747167, 3936, '<td valign="top">Somehow, with all the pink, I can''t help but be reminded of Horton Hears a Who.</td>', 'Somehow, with all the pink, I can''t help but be reminded of Horton Hears a Who.', '2008-12-20 13:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5142766, 746732, 3936, '<td valign="top">What a cool image.  The border is a little heavy for me, and distracts a tiny bit.  Really like the snow effect.  Nice use of depth of field to get the mood you wanted. 9</td>', 'What a cool image.  The border is a little heavy for me, and distracts a tiny bit.  Really like the snow effect.  Nice use of depth of field to get the mood you wanted. 9', '2008-12-20 13:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5142886, 747464, 100066, '<td valign="top">This is absolutely the best star that I''ve ever seen.<br/>My compliments ,<br/>Zeynep</td>', 'This is absolutely the best star that I''ve ever seen.My compliments ,Zeynep', '2008-12-20 15:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5142953, 747474, 73942, '<td valign="top">I like the backlighting on this.  Creative entry.</td>', 'I like the backlighting on this.  Creative entry.', '2008-12-20 16:25:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5143012, 746549, 51793, '<td valign="top">What an awesome shot, I can see this getting a top 10.</td>', 'What an awesome shot, I can see this getting a top 10.', '2008-12-20 17:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5143013, 747464, 51793, '<td valign="top">Now that is a cool looking shot. Good luck</td>', 'Now that is a cool looking shot. Good luck', '2008-12-20 17:10:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5143015, 747428, 51793, '<td valign="top">I think everything else over powers the stars in the image.</td>', 'I think everything else over powers the stars in the image.', '2008-12-20 17:10:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5143016, 747385, 51793, '<td valign="top">It''s an interesting image but it doesn''t really say look at me I''m a star.</td>', 'It''s an interesting image but it doesn''t really say look at me I''m a star.', '2008-12-20 17:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5143017, 747167, 51793, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot. I love how intense this is, although I want to see more of the gas on the left.</td>', 'Very cool shot. I love how intense this is, although I want to see more of the gas on the left.', '2008-12-20 17:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5143018, 747330, 51793, '<td valign="top">It''s a neat idea but it lacks personal appeal.</td>', 'It''s a neat idea but it lacks personal appeal.', '2008-12-20 17:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5143020, 747382, 51793, '<td valign="top">Although we can see the stars in the image they aren''t really "stars". It''s a fantastic image and if I were voting on the image itself I would give it a high score but they are lights not stars. The star affect is caused by the long shutter speed of the camera and I just don''t it really meets the challenge. BTW I am not voting just commenting on photos. Good luck</td>', 'Although we can see the stars in the image they aren''t really "stars". It''s a fantastic image and if I were voting on the image itself I would give it a high score but they are lights not stars. The star affect is caused by the long shutter speed of the camera and I just don''t it really meets the challenge. BTW I am not voting just commenting on photos. Good luck', '2008-12-20 17:14:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5143024, 747454, 51793, '<td valign="top">IMO the image looks sloppy. You should have tried to clean up the edges and tried to get the thread to come out all around it. Also adding some contrast would have helped with the flat lighting. NVCO</td>', 'IMO the image looks sloppy. You should have tried to clean up the edges and tried to get the thread to come out all around it. Also adding some contrast would have helped with the flat lighting. NVCO', '2008-12-20 17:17:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5143025, 747027, 51793, '<td valign="top">Looks like a place in a western movie.<br/>NVCO</td>', 'Looks like a place in a western movie.NVCO', '2008-12-20 17:17:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5143026, 746719, 51793, '<td valign="top">Yes he is about too isn''t he.<br/>NVCO</td>', 'Yes he is about too isn''t he.NVCO', '2008-12-20 17:18:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5143027, 746715, 51793, '<td valign="top">Looks like someone likes to play in the sand. <br/> <br/>NVCO</td>', 'Looks like someone likes to play in the sand.  NVCO', '2008-12-20 17:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5143028, 747309, 51793, '<td valign="top">tonight is how you spell it, hahaha  I don''t like the yellow though, you should have went with black or blue.<br/> <br/>NVCO</td>', 'tonight is how you spell it, hahaha  I don''t like the yellow though, you should have went with black or blue. NVCO', '2008-12-20 17:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5143031, 747290, 51793, '<td valign="top">Oh now this is an awesome photo, This is my pick for the blue.<br/>NVCO</td>', 'Oh now this is an awesome photo, This is my pick for the blue.NVCO', '2008-12-20 17:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
