(5144093, 746672, 93714, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot AND yes, there is a star... just made it... 7 for subtle</td>', 'Beautiful shot AND yes, there is a star... just made it... 7 for subtle', '2008-12-21 13:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5144131, 746859, 52549, '<td valign="top">I see a top 3 in your future ;-) Beautiful image.</td>', 'I see a top 3 in your future ;-) Beautiful image.', '2008-12-21 13:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5144133, 747449, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like it, though it comes across to me as oversharpened and overprocessed in a couple of places. Still giving it a 6.</td>', 'I like it, though it comes across to me as oversharpened and overprocessed in a couple of places. Still giving it a 6.', '2008-12-21 13:49:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5144134, 747437, 52549, '<td valign="top">The closest star of all. Lovely image.</td>', 'The closest star of all. Lovely image.', '2008-12-21 13:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5144136, 747071, 83313, '<td valign="top">This may not quite be what was intended for the challenge, can''t argue with facts, though. Our sun IS a star. Wonderful play of light on the crashing surf.</td>', 'This may not quite be what was intended for the challenge, can''t argue with facts, though. Our sun IS a star. Wonderful play of light on the crashing surf.', '2008-12-21 13:51:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5144139, 746825, 83313, '<td valign="top">Cactus? I thought it was a throw pillow before i read the title! Very neat looking.</td>', 'Cactus? I thought it was a throw pillow before i read the title! Very neat looking.', '2008-12-21 13:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5144142, 746343, 83313, '<td valign="top">Decent enough, though it comes off to me as a good snapshot. Maybe it''s the WB, it seems to have a bit of a yellowish cast to me.</td>', 'Decent enough, though it comes off to me as a good snapshot. Maybe it''s the WB, it seems to have a bit of a yellowish cast to me.', '2008-12-21 13:54:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5144144, 747137, 83313, '<td valign="top">Seems like just a snapshot at first glance, but then I find my eye exploring the shot, seeking out all the details. I suspect I will be giving this a much higher vote than what it will end up at, however.</td>', 'Seems like just a snapshot at first glance, but then I find my eye exploring the shot, seeking out all the details. I suspect I will be giving this a much higher vote than what it will end up at, however.', '2008-12-21 13:55:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5144147, 747469, 83313, '<td valign="top">Feels like a ''70s flashback! Nice work.  Just the right amount of focus and the blur takes my eye where it is supposed to go.</td>', 'Feels like a ''70s flashback! Nice work.  Just the right amount of focus and the blur takes my eye where it is supposed to go.', '2008-12-21 13:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5144149, 747175, 83313, '<td valign="top">Would love to see a larger version of this if you have it posted somewhere.</td>', 'Would love to see a larger version of this if you have it posted somewhere.', '2008-12-21 13:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5144150, 747500, 83313, '<td valign="top">Just seems rather plain to me. I think perhaps a change in the lighting may have shown off that juicy texture a little more, and appealed to me better. A good effort, though.</td>', 'Just seems rather plain to me. I think perhaps a change in the lighting may have shown off that juicy texture a little more, and appealed to me better. A good effort, though.', '2008-12-21 14:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5144151, 747235, 83313, '<td valign="top">Wonderful zoomblur and great colors. Just enough that is recognizable. I think I will fave this one. Very curious to see how it scores in the challenge.</td>', 'Wonderful zoomblur and great colors. Just enough that is recognizable. I think I will fave this one. Very curious to see how it scores in the challenge.', '2008-12-21 14:02:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5144153, 747330, 83313, '<td valign="top">This is going to seem weird, but my first impression on seeing this was movie hero tied up to columns and struggling to free himself.</td>', 'This is going to seem weird, but my first impression on seeing this was movie hero tied up to columns and struggling to free himself.', '2008-12-21 14:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5144155, 746856, 83313, '<td valign="top">Not caring for the negative image, or maybe it is just that it comes across to me with a lot of visible stairstepping. Not totally sure what it is or is not.</td>', 'Not caring for the negative image, or maybe it is just that it comes across to me with a lot of visible stairstepping. Not totally sure what it is or is not.', '2008-12-21 14:05:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5144157, 747309, 83313, '<td valign="top">Excellent moon shot, but the sky surrounding it needs a lot of smoothing, noise reduction or something. It got an extremely grainy appearance. I suspect you may also be getting slammed with a lot of low votes for DNMC, as it''s not a star.</td>', 'Excellent moon shot, but the sky surrounding it needs a lot of smoothing, noise reduction or something. It got an extremely grainy appearance. I suspect you may also be getting slammed with a lot of low votes for DNMC, as it''s not a star.', '2008-12-21 14:09:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5144159, 746968, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''ll be surprise if this is not int he top 20.</td>', 'I''ll be surprise if this is not int he top 20.', '2008-12-21 14:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5144211, 747481, 30861, '<td valign="top">I know this is going to draw opprobrium because it''s "just another backlit paper picture", but I don''t care. It''s exceptionally lovely, and a lot of effort has gone into it. My only quibble is that the lower left corner has gone too dark and is damaging the luminosity of the composition a little; my eye keeps being drawn there. Should ribbon, it''s a very joyous image.</td>', 'I know this is going to draw opprobrium because it''s "just another backlit paper picture", but I don''t care. It''s exceptionally lovely, and a lot of effort has gone into it. My only quibble is that the lower left corner has gone too dark and is damaging the luminosity of the composition a little; my eye keeps being drawn there. Should ribbon, it''s a very joyous image.', '2008-12-21 15:52:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5144214, 745820, 30861, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done...</td>', 'Beautifully done...', '2008-12-21 15:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5144217, 747235, 30861, '<td valign="top">Absolutely gorgeous and spontaneous feeling! I hope it ribbons.</td>', 'Absolutely gorgeous and spontaneous feeling! I hope it ribbons.', '2008-12-21 15:54:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5144220, 747348, 30861, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, soft bokeh, one of my favorites in this challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful, soft bokeh, one of my favorites in this challenge.', '2008-12-21 15:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5144221, 746672, 30861, '<td valign="top">Major points for subtlety, LOL...</td>', 'Major points for subtlety, LOL...', '2008-12-21 15:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
