(5144274, 747162, 14867, '<td valign="top">Good effort, technique still to be improved: though the star trails are very little, hardly visible, the sky is noisy.</td>', 'Good effort, technique still to be improved: though the star trails are very little, hardly visible, the sky is noisy.', '2008-12-21 16:43:04.000000', NULL, 1),
