(5144279, 747428, 14867, '<td valign="top">Powerful image, very well done (particularly the exposure), even if the connection with the stars is thin.</td>', 'Powerful image, very well done (particularly the exposure), even if the connection with the stars is thin.', '2008-12-21 16:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
