(5144516, 746239, 73452, '<td valign="top">ah man, i see you may be new to this?  a few pointers:<br/>1.  way way too much grain, its super distracting<br/>2.  the picure looks like a snapshot of friends <br/>3.  the use of turning the image into a negative,<br/>really makes this image negative in my eyes, i dont like it.<br/>4.  the overhead light is very distracting.<br/> <br/>Hope this helped, and keep trying!</td>', 'ah man, i see you may be new to this?  a few pointers:1.  way way too much grain, its super distracting2.  the picure looks like a snapshot of friends 3.  the use of turning the image into a negative,really makes this image negative in my eyes, i dont like it.4.  the overhead light is very distracting. Hope this helped, and keep trying!', '2008-12-21 18:44:49.000000', NULL, 1),
