(5144636, 746715, 63633, '<td valign="top">This feels a little off-centre, but I see that the boy is centered, and it''s just the word at the bottom that is the problem. Couldn''t be helped I guess. This evokes such a tropical feeling in me - hot summer nights and cool drinks. <br/> <br/>The boy looks a little under-exposed. Maybe a little dodging on him might have helped, because the rest of the shot is spot-on.</td>', 'This feels a little off-centre, but I see that the boy is centered, and it''s just the word at the bottom that is the problem. Couldn''t be helped I guess. This evokes such a tropical feeling in me - hot summer nights and cool drinks.  The boy looks a little under-exposed. Maybe a little dodging on him might have helped, because the rest of the shot is spot-on.', '2008-12-21 19:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
