(5144657, 747446, 63633, '<td valign="top">I really love the bokeh, but I''m not sold on the star itself. The composition isn''t centered, and it doesn''t obey the rule of thirds, so it sits funny in my (not very creative) mind. Still a very polished image.<br/> <br/>Also, I think the border is a bit much - there''s enough red and green already ! :)</td>', 'I really love the bokeh, but I''m not sold on the star itself. The composition isn''t centered, and it doesn''t obey the rule of thirds, so it sits funny in my (not very creative) mind. Still a very polished image. Also, I think the border is a bit much - there''s enough red and green already ! :)', '2008-12-21 19:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5144659, 747469, 63633, '<td valign="top">Is this Eric''s bokeh trick from the hearts challenge? I''ve been meaning to try it myself, but wondering if it''s going to be done to death in the bokeh challenge. Nicely done.</td>', 'Is this Eric''s bokeh trick from the hearts challenge? I''ve been meaning to try it myself, but wondering if it''s going to be done to death in the bokeh challenge. Nicely done.', '2008-12-21 19:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
