(5144662, 747219, 63633, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot. I might have scored it higher without the heads (I''m sure you are getting a lot of those comments) and had the subject matter not seemed like a bit of a shoehorn. Actually, I probably would have given it a 6 anyways (it''s clearly better than a 5, and just doesn''t stand out enough for a 7 in my mind. Would love to see some more theatre shots in future.<br/> <br/>Actually I change my mind about the shoehorn thing. I just wasn''t thinking outside the box enough.</td>', 'Lovely shot. I might have scored it higher without the heads (I''m sure you are getting a lot of those comments) and had the subject matter not seemed like a bit of a shoehorn. Actually, I probably would have given it a 6 anyways (it''s clearly better than a 5, and just doesn''t stand out enough for a 7 in my mind. Would love to see some more theatre shots in future. Actually I change my mind about the shoehorn thing. I just wasn''t thinking outside the box enough.', '2008-12-21 19:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
