(5144871, 746859, 63633, '<td valign="top">Wow, it really does look light daylight! I think this image struggles with the horizon line.  It''s not obeying the rule of thirds, nor is it dissecting the image in half. I think that it would have been a stronger composition if there had been more ground included and less sky, but being a star challenge, I can see why you chose to do it this way. I think voters would have forgiven you for including less of the stars.</td>', 'Wow, it really does look light daylight! I think this image struggles with the horizon line.  It''s not obeying the rule of thirds, nor is it dissecting the image in half. I think that it would have been a stronger composition if there had been more ground included and less sky, but being a star challenge, I can see why you chose to do it this way. I think voters would have forgiven you for including less of the stars.', '2008-12-21 21:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
