(5146418, 746239, 93927, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by photokariangel:</b></div><hr/><i> ah man, <b>i see you may be new to this?</b>  a few pointers:<br/>1.  way way too much grain, its super distracting<br/>2.  the picure looks like a snapshot of friends <br/>3.  the use of turning the image into a negative,<br/>really makes this image negative in my eyes, i dont like it.<br/>4.  the overhead light is very distracting.<br/> <br/>Hope this helped, and keep trying! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>LOL Anyone else find this kind of ironic figuring he''s on site council?<br/> <br/>:P</td>', 'Originally posted by photokariangel: ah man, i see you may be new to this?  a few pointers:1.  way way too much grain, its super distracting2.  the picure looks like a snapshot of friends 3.  the use of turning the image into a negative,really makes this image negative in my eyes, i dont like it.4.  the overhead light is very distracting. Hope this helped, and keep trying!   LOL Anyone else find this kind of ironic figuring he''s on site council? :P', '2008-12-22 14:36:42.000000', NULL, 0),
