(5147042, 746165, 70375, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Jacci:</b></div><hr/><i> what does that mean???  That''s two references and I''m lost (titular Shoehorn)... </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/><b>Titular:</b> A title of an artistic work. <b>Shoehorn:</b> A photo entered in a challenge where it doesn''t belong by giving it a creative name or title.<br/> <br/>Welcome to DPC :)</td>', 'Originally posted by Jacci: what does that mean???  That''s two references and I''m lost (titular Shoehorn)...   Titular: A title of an artistic work. Shoehorn: A photo entered in a challenge where it doesn''t belong by giving it a creative name or title. Welcome to DPC :)', '2008-12-22 22:59:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(5147050, 746165, 3936, '<td valign="top">Shoehorns are references to images that do not really fit the challenge, but the photographer uses the title to try to fit the image into the challenge.  In this case the those who take the challenges literally are referring to the fact that there is not a physical star in your image.  Personally, the challenge refers to the fact that not all the stars are in the sky, so for me a picture of a star, or in your case a glamor shot that looks like it could be someone who is a star, fits the challenge well.<br/> <br/>Others are looking for a glowing gaseous ball, or a star shaped object. You will find them along the way during your journey here.</td>', 'Shoehorns are references to images that do not really fit the challenge, but the photographer uses the title to try to fit the image into the challenge.  In this case the those who take the challenges literally are referring to the fact that there is not a physical star in your image.  Personally, the challenge refers to the fact that not all the stars are in the sky, so for me a picture of a star, or in your case a glamor shot that looks like it could be someone who is a star, fits the challenge well. Others are looking for a glowing gaseous ball, or a star shaped object. You will find them along the way during your journey here.', '2008-12-22 23:02:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(5147052, 746165, 63503, '<td valign="top">He meant to say that you forced the picture into meeting the challenge by using the word ''star'' in the title. I disagree, I think you are showing a ''celebrity'' type subject, maybe a movie or show-business ''star'' of sorts, so, I think it did meet the challenge. Besides, I think it is a great photo.</td>', 'He meant to say that you forced the picture into meeting the challenge by using the word ''star'' in the title. I disagree, I think you are showing a ''celebrity'' type subject, maybe a movie or show-business ''star'' of sorts, so, I think it did meet the challenge. Besides, I think it is a great photo.', '2008-12-22 23:02:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(5147068, 746165, 88136, '<td valign="top">hey not too bad for a first entry! im very impressed, you should see my first lol. i love the texture on here scarf, her face seems a bit oof(out of focus), but thats ok. you''ll learn from it:)</td>', 'hey not too bad for a first entry! im very impressed, you should see my first lol. i love the texture on here scarf, her face seems a bit oof(out of focus), but thats ok. you''ll learn from it:)', '2008-12-22 23:09:40.000000', NULL, 0),
