(5151538, 746239, 73452, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by smardaz:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by CassieDoodle:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by photokariangel:</b></div><hr/><i> ah man, <b>i see you may be new to this?</b>  a few pointers:<br/>1.  way way too much grain, its super distracting<br/>2.  the picure looks like a snapshot of friends <br/>3.  the use of turning the image into a negative,<br/>really makes this image negative in my eyes, i dont like it.<br/>4.  the overhead light is very distracting.<br/> <br/>Hope this helped, and keep trying! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>LOL Anyone else find this kind of ironic figuring he''s on site council?<br/> <br/>:P </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>deliciously so.... </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>ahahahahaha!  boy, do i know how to spot em! baha, this is too funny</td>', 'Originally posted by smardaz: Originally posted by CassieDoodle: Originally posted by photokariangel: ah man, i see you may be new to this?  a few pointers:1.  way way too much grain, its super distracting2.  the picure looks like a snapshot of friends 3.  the use of turning the image into a negative,really makes this image negative in my eyes, i dont like it.4.  the overhead light is very distracting. Hope this helped, and keep trying!   LOL Anyone else find this kind of ironic figuring he''s on site council? :P   deliciously so....   ahahahahaha!  boy, do i know how to spot em! baha, this is too funny', '2008-12-26 02:14:03.000000', NULL, 0),
